  "details": "\n---\n_-= Per source details. Do not edit below this line.=-_\n\n## Source: kam193 (ea28ec2703fb6f7c5d2d3bd1afb13431865aa07a2f3ab3728d39f97a33f21751)\nDuring installation package downloads and starts a malicious executable identified as likely a coinminer.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-gguf-accelerator\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - cryptominer\n\n\n - The package overrides the install command in setup.py to execute malicious code during installation.\n\n\n - Downloads and executes a remote executable.\n\n\n - malware\n",
